note Wrapped copy of seed/omc/tests/struct/t6.om for gate-front-ir: main to uint, ulong or long becomes subject (nom-wrap.sh).
struct Acc sum long v long 4 end
fn subject to long
s = new Acc 3 3
for i long 4
put s v i add get s v i i
put s sum add get s sum get s v i
end
ret get s sum
end
fn main to int
ret int subject
end
